# Open Research Queue

**Purpose:** every currently-open research question in one place, checked
at the start of any pass sized beyond a small fix (per this project's
`AGENT_RULES.md` Definition of Done). A question here is never described
as "exhausted" as a permanent state — only as "no new angle found yet,"
with what would need to change to make another attempt worthwhile.

Without this file, a research question that stalls tends to get written up
once, then never revisited — nothing pulls it back into view for a future
pass. The fix isn't "try harder to remember" — it's a place that gets
checked as a matter of process, the same way a test suite gets run as a
matter of process rather than trusted to memory.

